  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:birkat_hamazon/veal_hakol">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/veal_hakol/1"/>For everything Adonoy, our God,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/veal_hakol/2"/>We thank You
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/veal_hakol/3"/>and bless You.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/veal_hakol/4"/>Blessed be Your Name
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/veal_hakol/5"/>through the mouth of all the living,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/veal_hakol/6"/>constantly, forever, as it is written:
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:deuteronomy/8/10"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/veal_hakol/7"/>When You have eaten and are satisfied,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/veal_hakol/8"/>You will bless Adonoy, your God,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/veal_hakol/9"/>for the good land
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/veal_hakol/10"/>which He has given to you.<tei:anchor xml:id="note_1"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/veal_hakol/11"/>Blessed are You, Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/veal_hakol/12"/>for the land and for the food.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
